WEBVTT

54:38.642 --> 54:41.268
Sorry. I thought
that you were gonna...

54:42.103 --> 54:43.938
You know, you know, eat my friend.

54:44.230 --> 54:46.106
Hey, no, no, wait, hey!

54:46.191 --> 54:47.608
-What's wrong?
-Sid?

54:47.692 --> 54:49.360
Not now, Mom! I'm busy!

54:49.444 --> 54:51.862
-Sid! Buzz, come on!
-You left that door open.

54:51.947 --> 54:56.367
Get up! Use your legs! Fine!
Let Sid trash you! But don't blame me!

54:58.662 --> 55:01.914
It came!
It finally came!
